item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_cleaner.tooltip=The Janitor will pick up dropped items and deposit them into a target inventory.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_transport_items.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_transport_items.tooltip=The Transporter will move all items it can access from one inventory to another, including machines.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_farmer.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_farmer.tooltip=The Farmer will harvest crops in it's working area and deposit the dropped items into the specified chest.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_lumberjack.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_lumberjack.tooltip=The Lumberjack will harvest trees in it's working area and deposit the dropped items into the specified chest.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_smelter.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_smelter.tooltip=The Smelter is a spirit summoned to make furnace, blast furnace, smoker and campfire recipes without using fuel and faster depending of the spirit.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_crusher.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_crusher.tooltip=The Crusher is a spirit summoned to crush ores into dusts, effectively doubling the metal output.\n§7§oNote: Some recipes may require higher or lower tier crushers.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_crystallizer.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_crystallizer.tooltip=The Crystallizer is a spirit summoned to turn gem dusts back to gems and can extract extra gems from ores.\n§7§oNote: Some recipes may require higher or lower tier crystallizers.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_otherstone_trader.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_otherstone_trader.tooltip=The Otherstone Trader trades normal stone for otherstone.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_otherrock_trader.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_otherrock_trader.tooltip=The Otherrock Trader trades normal stone for otherrock.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_sapling_trader.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_foliot_sapling_trader.tooltip=The Otherworld Sapling Trader trades natural otherworld saplings for stable ones, that can be harvested without the third eye.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_skeleton.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_skeleton.tooltip=The Possessed Skeleton is immune to daylight and always drop at least one Skeleton Skull when killed.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_endermite.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_endermite.tooltip=The Possessed Endermite can be healed with Demon's Dream Fruit and drops 1-2 End Stone when killed.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_witch.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_witch.tooltip=Summons the dedicated 1.12 Possessed Witch with increased health and its custom bottle and redstone drops.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_phantom.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_phantom.tooltip=Summons the custom 1.12 Possessed Phantom. It circles above its target, swoops to attack, is immune to fire and daylight, and drops 1-4 Phantom Membranes.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_enderman.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_enderman.tooltip=The Possessed Enderman can be healed with Demon's Dream Fruit and drops 1-3 Ender Pearls when killed.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_blaze.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_blaze.tooltip=Summons the dedicated 1.12 Possessed Blaze. It has increased health, speed and attack damage, and is immune to fire, water and snowballs.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_ghast.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_ghast.tooltip=The fire-immune Possessed Ghast can be healed with Demon's Dream Fruit and drops Ghast Tears and Gunpowder.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_unbound_parrot.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_unbound_parrot.tooltip=Summons an untamed 1.12 Parrot using a chicken sacrifice and vanilla dye colors.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_parrot.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_parrot.tooltip=Summons a 1.12 Parrot familiar. The local ritual has the upstream chicken chance: sometimes the spirit misunderstands and a chicken appears instead.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_bat.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_bat.tooltip=The Bat familiar provides night vision to its master while nearby. A Blacksmith can upgrade it once to also grant Lifesteal, healing 1 health point whenever the affected master kills an entity. Familiar Ring storage and the native one-slot ring effects are supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_cthulhu.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_cthulhu.tooltip=The Cthulhu familiar provides Water Breathing to its nearby owner and can be stored in a Familiar Ring. Once upgraded by a Blacksmith Familiar, it acts as a mobile light source.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_blacksmith.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_blacksmith.tooltip=The Blacksmith familiar takes stone its owner mines and uses it to repair equipment.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_greedy.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_greedy.tooltip=Summons a Greedy Familiar that picks up nearby items for its owner. A Blacksmith can upgrade it once to locate matching blocks of a selected type; interact with a block to set the sample and interact again to retrieve it. Familiar Ring storage and the native one-slot ring effects are supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_dragon.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_dragon.tooltip=The Dragon Familiar increases experience gained by its nearby owner, loves sticks, and can carry a same-owner Greedy Familiar. A Blacksmith upgrade replaces its fire attack with thrown swords. Familiar Ring storage and the native one-slot ring effects are supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_fairy.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_fairy.tooltip=The Fairy Familiar saves other familiars from death on a cooldown, grants situational support effects, and drains enemies to heal its owner and allied familiars. It cannot be upgraded by a Blacksmith Familiar. Familiar Ring storage and the native one-slot ring behavior are supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_beholder.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_beholder.tooltip=The Beholder Familiar fires rays at its owner's recent enemies and eats nearby Shub Niggurath Spawn for temporary Strength and Speed. A Blacksmith upgrade grants its owner blindness immunity. Familiar Ring storage and the native one-slot ring behavior are supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_chimera.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_chimera.tooltip=Feed the Chimera Familiar meat to make it larger, stronger, faster, and eventually rideable. Its goat can be detached with a golden apple and transformed into Shub Niggurath. Familiar Ring storage and the native one-slot ring behavior are supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_deer.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_deer.tooltip=The Deer familiar provides Speed, Jump Boost, and step assist to its master while nearby. A Blacksmith can upgrade it once with a warhammer that strikes and ignites its master's recent enemies. Familiar Ring storage is supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_beaver.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_beaver.tooltip=The Beaver familiar helps its master harvest logs and chops nearby small sapling-grown trees. A Blacksmith can upgrade it once, after which it dispenses a free Beaver Nugget to its master after a short cooldown. Familiar Ring storage and the native one-slot ring effects are supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_mummy.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_mummy.tooltip=The Mummy familiar protects its master in melee and grants a nearby dodge chance. A Blacksmith can upgrade it once for +3 attack damage. Familiar Ring storage and the native one-slot ring effects are supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_devil.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_devil.tooltip=The Devil familiar provides Fire Resistance to its master and burns enemies that recently hurt or were hurt by its master. A Blacksmith upgrade lets it turn normal Golden Apples into Enchanted Golden Apples once every 33 minutes. The modern golden dream-fruit input has no 1.12 equivalent. Familiar Ring storage and the native one-slot ring effects are supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_guardian.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_guardian.tooltip=The Guardian familiar spawns with a random number of lives and sacrifices one life to prevent its master's death. If it has fewer than five lives, a Blacksmith can upgrade it once to restore one life. Familiar Ring storage and the native one-slot ring effects are supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_headless.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_headless.tooltip=The Headless Ratman familiar steals heads from nearby killed enemies and increases its master's damage against that kind of enemy. A Blacksmith can upgrade it once to weaken nearby enemies matching its current head and add a spectral-flame aura. Familiar Ring storage and the native one-slot ring effects are supported.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_otherworld_bird.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.familiar_otherworld_bird.tooltip=Summons a 1.12-compatible Drikwing Familiar. It follows its owner, grants Jump Boost and local Slow Falling, and can be stored in a Familiar Ring.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_wild_otherworld_bird.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_wild_otherworld_bird.tooltip=Summons an untamed 1.12-compatible Drikwing that can be tamed by anyone, not just the summoner.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_demonic_husband.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_demonic_husband.tooltip=Summons a Demonic Husband to support you: He will fight for you, help with cooking, and extend potion durations.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_demonic_wife.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_demonic_wife.tooltip=Summons a Demonic Wife to support you: She will fight for you, help with cooking, and extend potion durations.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_unbound_otherworld_bird.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_unbound_otherworld_bird.tooltip=Summons an untamed 1.12-compatible Drikwing as the local substitute for the unbound otherworld bird ritual.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_weak_shulker.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_weak_shulker.tooltip=The Possessed Weak Shulker has 10 health and drops 1-3 Chorus Fruit, with a chance to drop a Shulker Shell.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_shulker.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_shulker.tooltip=The fire-immune Possessed Shulker has 40 health and always drops at least one Shulker Shell.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_guardian.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit (Unbound)
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_guardian.tooltip=Summons the dedicated 1.12 Possessed Guardian with increased health, armor and custom prismarine and ocean drops.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_elder_guardian.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_elder_guardian.tooltip=The fire-immune Possessed Elder Guardian has 160 health and drops 2-4 Nautilus Shells plus its 1.12 guardian drops.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_zombified_piglin.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit (Unbound)
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_zombified_piglin.tooltip=Summons the dedicated 1.12 Possessed Zombified Piglin. It is fire immune, cannot call reinforcements and drops Demonic Meat.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_hoglin.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_hoglin.tooltip=Summons a dedicated 1.12 Possessed Hoglin with 66 health, 12 attack, fire immunity, hostile melee, and knockback; it uses porkchop and leather drops because modern Nether loot is unavailable.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_warden.name=Ritual: Summon Possessed Warden
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_warden.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_warden.tooltip=Summons a 1.12 Warden compatibility entity with 250 health, 15 attack, fire immunity, melee knockback, a periodic sonic pulse, and a local blindness field.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_goat.auto_tooltip=Tier: Marid
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_goat.tooltip=Summons a local Goat of Mercy. It charges nearby non-creative players, deals 4 damage and knockback, and drops Cruelty Essence when killed.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_bee.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_bee.tooltip=Summons a local Possessed Bee. It poisons targets, can call a capped reinforcement swarm when hurt, and returns to a local Bee Nest when idle. Kill it to obtain Cursed Honey.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_iesnium_golem.auto_tooltip=Tier: Marid
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_iesnium_golem.tooltip=Summons the registered Iesnium Golem. It has 1 health, 100 attack damage, permanent persistence, and rejects all damage except a direct melee hit from a sneaking player.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_random_animal_common.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_random_animal_common.tooltip=Summons one random common animal from the 1.12-compatible entity tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_random_animal_rideable.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_random_animal_rideable.tooltip=Summons one random rideable animal from the 1.12-compatible entity tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_random_animal_small.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_random_animal_small.tooltip=Summons one random small animal from the 1.12-compatible entity tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_random_animal_special.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_random_animal_special.tooltip=Summons one random special animal from the 1.12-compatible entity tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_random_animal_water.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_random_animal_water.tooltip=Summons one random water-themed animal from the 1.12-compatible entity tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_villager.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.possess_villager.tooltip=Summons one villager from the 1.12-compatible villager tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_random_animal_common.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_random_animal_common.tooltip=Summons seven random common animals from the 1.12-compatible entity tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_random_animal_rideable.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_random_animal_rideable.tooltip=Summons three random rideable animals from the 1.12-compatible entity tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_random_animal_small.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_random_animal_small.tooltip=Summons seven random small animals from the 1.12-compatible entity tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_random_animal_special.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_random_animal_special.tooltip=Summons three random special animals from the 1.12-compatible entity tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_random_animal_water.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_random_animal_water.tooltip=Summons seven random water-themed animals from the 1.12-compatible entity tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_villager.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_villager.tooltip=Summons three villagers from the 1.12-compatible villager tag mapping.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_hunt.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_hunt.tooltip=The Wild Hunt consists of Wither Skeletons with a high chance to drop Wither Skeleton Skulls, and their minions.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_wild_hunt.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_wild_hunt.tooltip=The Wild Hunt consists of Wither Skeletons with a high chance to drop Wither Skeleton Skulls, and their minions.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_wild_parrot.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_wild_parrot.tooltip=Summons an untamed 1.12 Parrot that can be tamed by anyone, not just the summoner.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_wild_afrit.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_wild_afrit.tooltip=Summons a wild 1.12-compatible Afrit with a blaze entourage. Killing it yields Afrit Essence.
ritual.occultism.summon_wild_parrot.conditions=Not all requirements for this ritual are met.
ritual.occultism.summon_wild_parrot.finished=Summoned wild parrot successfully.
ritual.occultism.summon_wild_parrot.interrupted=Summoning of wild parrot interrupted.
ritual.occultism.summon_wild_parrot.started=Started summoning wild parrot.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_horde_illager.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_horde_illager.tooltip=Summons one registered Wild Horde Evoker with the 1.12 Evoker spellcasting AI.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_creeper.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_creeper.tooltip=Summons five registered charged Wild Horde Creepers for the wild creeper horde ritual.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_husk.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_husk.tooltip=Summons five registered Wild Horde Husks and uses llamas as the 1.12 sacrifice substitute.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_parched.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_parched.tooltip=Summons five registered Stray-based Wild Parched entities for the horde ritual.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_drowned.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_drowned.tooltip=Summons five registered sunlight-proof Zombie-based Wild Drowned entities.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_silverfish.auto_tooltip=Tier: Wild Spirit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.wild_silverfish.tooltip=Summons five registered Wild Horde Silverfish for the wild silverfish horde ritual.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.resurrect_familiar.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.resurrect_familiar.tooltip=Restores the Familiar stored in a soul shard and binds it to the caster.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.resurrect_allay.auto_tooltip=Tier: Familiar
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.resurrect_allay.tooltip=Purifies a 1.12 Vex into a local Allay substitute bound to the caster. It follows its owner, retrieves nearby items, and returns them to the owner.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.resurrect_mob.auto_tooltip=Tier: Foliot
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.resurrect_mob.tooltip=Restores the entity stored in a shattered soul shard.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_clear_weather.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_clear_weather.tooltip=Summons a Djinni that clears the weather after 15 seconds, then vanishes.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_day_time.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_day_time.tooltip=Summons a Djinni that advances time to the next dawn over 5 seconds, then vanishes.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_night_time.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_night_time.tooltip=Summons a Djinni that advances time to the next dusk over 5 seconds, then vanishes.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_smelter.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_smelter.tooltip=Summons a local Djinni-tier smelter spirit using the existing 1.12 worker job loop. Blast Furnace and Smoker inputs are replaced by vanilla furnaces.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_crusher.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_crusher.tooltip=Summons a local Djinni-tier crusher spirit using the existing 1.12 worker job loop. It is stronger than a Foliot but does not yet have a dedicated upstream Djinni model or AI.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_crystallizer.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_crystallizer.tooltip=Summons a local Djinni-tier crystallizer spirit using the existing 1.12 worker job loop. Amethyst is represented by the local spirit-attuned gem path.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_gambler.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_gambler.tooltip=Summons a local Djinni-tier gambler. It consumes gem inputs and returns one weighted random gem or small metal reward using the upstream gambler weights.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_manage_machine.name=Ritual: Summon Djinni Machine Operator
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_manage_machine.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_manage_machine.tooltip=Summons a Djinni machine operator that transfers items between a storage controller and configured item-handler faces.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_smelter.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_smelter.tooltip=Summons a local Afrit-tier smelter spirit using the existing 1.12 worker job loop. Red Nether Bricks and Soul Campfire are replaced by Nether Brick and Soul Sand.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_crusher.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_crusher.tooltip=Summons a local Afrit-tier crusher spirit using tier 3 job data. The ritual uses local Iesnium, amethyst, emerald, lapis, and obsidian dusts.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_crystallizer.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_crystallizer.tooltip=Summons a local Afrit-tier crystallizer spirit. Modern Amethyst and Dripstone blocks are represented by local Amethyst Block and vanilla Quartz Blocks.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_marid_smelter.auto_tooltip=Tier: Marid
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_marid_smelter.tooltip=Summons a local Marid-tier smelter spirit using tier 4 job data. Crying Obsidian and Spirit Campfire are replaced by vanilla Obsidian and Soul Sand.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_marid_crusher.auto_tooltip=Tier: Marid
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_marid_crusher.tooltip=Summons a local Marid-tier crusher spirit. Netherite block cost is mapped through the local Iesnium-backed netherite block substitute.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_marid_crystallizer.auto_tooltip=Tier: Marid
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_marid_crystallizer.tooltip=Summons a local Marid-tier crystallizer spirit. It can turn the local Amethyst Block into Budding Amethyst; 1.12 has no Crying Obsidian or Sculk Catalyst, so those remain documented compatibility differences.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_wondering_trader.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_wondering_trader.tooltip=Summons the 1.12 Wondering Trader port. Mundane villager trades are shown normally; Third Eye, Otherworld Goggles, or a True Sight Staff reveals the persistent otherworld trade table.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_rain_weather.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_rain_weather.tooltip=Summons an Afrit that brings rain after 30 seconds, then vanishes.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_thunder_weather.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_thunder_weather.tooltip=Summons an Afrit that brings a thunderstorm after 60 seconds, then vanishes.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_prototype.auto_tooltip=Tier: Djinni
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_djinni_prototype.tooltip=Summons a local bound Djinni entity. It can be named, stored in a magic lamp, healed with spirit food, and restored from a soul shard.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_unbound_afrit.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_unbound_afrit.tooltip=Summons a hostile unbound Afrit with a blaze entourage using Kandar's Opened Conjure.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_unbound_afrit_prototype.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_unbound_afrit_prototype.tooltip=Summons a hostile unbound Afrit with a blaze entourage using the prototype route.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_prototype.auto_tooltip=Tier: Afrit
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_afrit_prototype.tooltip=Summons a local bound Afrit entity. Selected Afrit crusher, crystallizer, and smelter jobs are available through the local tiered worker loop; upstream AI and model parity remains separate.
item.occultism.ritual_dummy.summon_unbound_marid.auto_tooltip=Tier: Marid
