book.occultism.dictionary_of_spirits.pentacles.craft_foliot.intro.text=**Purpose:** Bind [#](AA00AA)Foliot[#]()\\n\\nAs a simple binding pentacle, **Eziveus Spectral Compulsion** is a common starting point for object\n infusion with lower spirits. The enchantment is made permanent by stabilizing candles.\n
book.occultism.dictionary_of_spirits.pentacles.craft_foliot.intro.title=Eziveus Spectral Compulsion
book.occultism.dictionary_of_spirits.pentacles.craft_foliot.name=Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion
book.occultism.dictionary_of_spirits.pentacles.craft_foliot.uses.text=- [Research Fragment Dust](entry://occultism:dictionary_of_spirits/pentacles/lime_chalk)\n- [Nature Paste](entry://occultism:dictionary_of_spirits/pentacles/green_chalk)\n- [Infused Lenses](entry://occultism:dictionary_of_spirits/crafting_rituals/craft_otherworld_goggles)\n- [Fragile Soul Gem](entry://occultism:dictionary_of_spirits/crafting_rituals/fragile_soul_gem)\n- [Vitality Compass](entry://occultism:dictionary_of_spirits/crafting_rituals/vitality_compass)\n- [Knowledge Tablet](entry://occultism:dictionary_of_spirits/crafting_rituals/knowledge_tablet)\n- [Foliot Miner](entry://occultism:dictionary_of_spirits/crafting_rituals/craft_foliot_miner)\n
